# Frontend structure (hard rules)

- Pages live under `app/(marketing)/` or `app/admin/`.
- Each page is its own folder with `page.tsx` + local `components/`.
- `page.tsx` only imports and composes components — no large inline UI.
- Shared/reusable UI goes in `components/ui/`.
- Central typography lives under `components/ui/` (see `typography.tsx`).
- **No source file exceeds 300 lines.**
- UI used more than once must be extracted as a reusable component.
- Follow `.cursor/skills/frontend-ui-ux-skill/SKILL.md` for UI/UX standards.
